# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=xcb-util-keysyms
pkgver=0.4.1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="XCB key symbol helpers, for Mesa's X11 Vulkan"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxcb)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/xcb-util-keysyms-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('7c260a5294412aed429df1da2f8afd3bd07b7cba3fec772fba15a613a6d5c638')

build() {
    cd xcb-util-keysyms-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd xcb-util-keysyms-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
